// Era 0–2 processes. Durations are real-world times of skilled people (a novice takes twice as
// long); the day scale compresses them (a 15-minute task ≈ 30 s of play at the default day
// length). Processes without `knowledge` are open to anyone: gathering, and the experiments by
// which knowledge is found (their verbs emit the discovery triggers the knowledge graph listens
// for). Bulk materials are counted by the kilogram in the units their bulk forms hold.
(
    schema: 1,
